Lojban doesn't mark names by capitalization, which is used to indicate
stress, although rarely (usually acute accent marks are used). Thus
{Ucauricu'um} is stressed on the first 'u' (which is okay if that's how you
say it), and {Zurzulapitcis} is not Lojban, despite it following {la}.

stevo


